# Wave W17-N (Route 112): fume sand — chimney-road sand, warm-toned from the mountain’s breath, the road that climbs to Scorch Path’s mouths (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end, Route 111 to the Smokestack’s foot). The warmest road sand in Maris — split from Route 111’s stone-worn dune track by warmth and from Route 110’s greyed walking sand by hue.
